+| File                 | From                                                                                          | Licence                                                                    |
+| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `prism-launcher.svg` | [PrismLauncher/PrismLauncher](https://github.com/PrismLauncher/PrismLauncher), `program_info` | [CC BY-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/), unchanged |
+| `polymc.svg`         | [PolyMC/PolyMC](https://github.com/PolyMC/PolyMC), `program_info`                             | [CC BY-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/), unchanged |
+| `atlauncher.svg`     | [ATLauncher/ATLauncher](https://github.com/ATLauncher/ATLauncher), `packaging/linux`          | GPL-3.0, unchanged                                                         |
+| `gdlauncher.png`     | [gorilla-devs/GDLauncher](https://github.com/gorilla-devs/GDLauncher), `public/icon.png`      | GPL-3.0, scaled down to 128×128                                            |
+| `multimc.svg`        | [MultiMC/Launcher](https://github.com/MultiMC/Launcher), `branding`                           | No licence given; shown to name the launcher, optimised with svgo          |
+
+CurseForge's logo is the one Modrinth already ships in `@modrinth/assets`.
+
+A launcher without a logo here falls back to a badge with its initials.
